[S1] g 的点态性质 (扫描 d in (1e-9, 2pi-1e-9))
================================================================================================
  g(0+)=8.333e-20   g(pi)=0.903165   g(2pi-)=4.512e+01  (-> +inf)
  min g'(d) = 0.0000000002    (理论 0, 在 d->0)          g' >= 0 : True
  min g''(d) (log grid d in 1e-8..10) = 0.166259765625   (理论 inf = 1/6 = 0.166666666667)
  g''(d) = 1/6 + d^2/60 + O(d^4)  =>  g'' >= 1/6 全局 [T] (网格下界差 1e-8 为网格效应)
  max g'(d) = 2.000e+09  (d=6.2831853062)  ==> 梯度上确界 = +inf (d -> 2pi^-)
  omega(s)=g'(|s|)sgn(s): 奇, omega(0)=0, omega(s)/s -> 1/6 (s->0)
    s     :    0.0001    0.0100    0.1000    1.0000    3.0000
    omega :  0.000017  0.001667  0.016669  0.169512  0.595752
    s/6   :  0.000017  0.001667  0.016667  0.166667  0.500000
    w-s/6 :  2.00e-12  2.78e-09  2.78e-06  2.85e-03  9.58e-02
  ==> g' >= 0, g'' >= 1/6 [T];  |nabla Phi| 无上界, 发散的集合 = {d_ab = 2pi} (cut locus) [T]

================================================================================================
[S2] Phi' 显式:  Phi'(X;v) = sum_{a<b} g'(d_ab) sgn(lam_a-lam_b) <(P_a-P_b),v>
     = <sum_a c_a P_a, v>,  c_a = sum_{b!=a} omega(lam_a-lam_b)   [T]
================================================================================================
  (i) SU(2): X = (rho/2) n.sigma  => Phi = g(rho) 径向  => Phi'(v) = (g'(rho)/rho)<X,v>
      切片 <X,v>=0 上  Phi' == 0 逐点 (与 beta、theta 无关)   [T]  (r11[A]: 8.6e-42)
      n=(0.6,0.8,0), v=(0.8,-0.6,0): <X,v>=0 (正交切片).  Phi'(v) 解析 = (g'(rho)/rho)*0 = 0
      g'(rho)/rho = 0.1723782832    Phi''(横向) = g'(rho)/rho
      rho    g'(rho)/rho    g''(rho)   (横向/径向 Phi'')
      0.90    0.168960957   0.173639948
      1.40    0.172378283   0.184363421
      2.20    0.181874002   0.216301126

  (ii) SU(3): 反例 + 三次律 (r11[C-ii] 复现)
      X=diag[-1.5797  0.3243  1.2554]  v=diag[ 0.9153 -2.7871  1.8718]   a=<X,v>/||v||^2 = 8.41e-06  (在切片上)
      Phi'(X;v) = sum g'(x_a-x_b)(e_a-e_b) = +0.0080468683   (!= 0) [T]
      但 Hess Phi(0) = (N/12)Id 各向同性 => 二次阶是径向的, 各向异性从四次项起 (r11 的三次律)
      t      Phi(tx)      Phi/t^2      (N/12)||tx||^2
      0.05     0.002611    1.044299    0.002610
      0.10     0.010447    1.044709    0.010442
      0.20     0.041854    1.046354    0.041767
      0.40     0.168488    1.053049    0.167066
      1.00     1.106003    1.106003    1.044163
      2.00     6.179570    1.544892    4.176652
      => Phi(tx)/t^2 -> (N/12)||x||^2: 二次型各向同性 => Phi' = O(|x|^3) 的各向异性部分 [T]

